 C/A7:,NAME,
C===========================================================
C C/A7 - write M10 packed characters at M11 in a plain integer
C field width supplied in ACC.  P/7AD performs the actual output;
C C/SP supplies any leading spaces and returns through P/7AD.
C===========================================================
 P/HIDE:,SUBP,
 P/7AD:,SUBP,
 C/SP:,SUBP,
 15,XTA,                     . Pop the width argument
 1,ATX,3                     . Save plain width in runtime scratch
 14,VJM,P/HIDE               . Save M13 and M6..M8
 11,MTJ,8                    . M8 := character address
 10,MTJ,7                    . M7 := character count
 ,ITA,10                     . ACC := plain character count
 ,NTR,7                      . Plain P2C integer arithmetic
 1,A-X,3                     . ACC := count - width
 13,VTM,P/7AD                . C/SP returns into the actual writer
 ,UJ,C/SP
 ,END,
